<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed clashes continue in Bangui as government forces, former Séléka rebels and Anti-balaka militias fight, with Russian Wagner forces and Africa Corps protecting President Touadéra. Fighting has spread from Sudan into the Central African Republic, prompting the United Nations to warn against a premature withdrawal of peacekeepers. Chad arrested four suspects after an attack in Miski, and France is re-engaging in the Sahel, emphasizing Chad’s strategic importance. The conflict caused 246 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE01NENUci02cmo0cVl6Tkd4OGVMd0w5ZUw0RTNoeFNhR3ZOaFV6MVcxSWZlMXNERkFidkFHUXJIVHg0aE9hV1RobjdJYnZxSUNQYlBJQ3ZJdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQU1l5WXBqS0JMNU5uZEFZY2s1UURDQ2N2bDhwSnQxUnlUUjNYVEZQclR6NWh6Sk9yajVUN1JnMHYzYUhNWkxsU01kTm1FSW5NY25keWl2SE00Q2VaWlF6cy1RR3RmS3JNSFVZSVJtX3JBcVFRX1BXUGZ2TG5KTHFhVU5LNVBGcFVVbXNFMUNNek94dDRjUHEweFIteGNYaXJMVWJXOWZfU19zOWR4NHQ4LTRnUnFMd3VsOUxEZ2xtdTAtc3ktYVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE02RFBMOExZSDlDU29jMDlyQkRxNFNORV80ZjFZSV9MSDJ3RU9kTGQxODdoeWUtaThlMmU5OGVlRldyMm1JTlNlNXlYdkgyRHJBOHJnTUxUVVVMU1NfTno0VVZfSHZoczRrb0Vmc3RidS11aUxQNUZNcE5n?oc=5&quot;&gt;APAnews - Agence de Presse Africaine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africanews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQU0RGU25LQUJwSnJOcV9CQVpfZVZGQVF0T1luNk5OSTF0eVZUT2JrbHdoUkd5ZDRlSmR0b1BpaVZLWjd1TjNiZWloZ0hCQnotT0ZSdjJ0WnlEX3JYeEY0M1FTXzVRX29WeG5iTTk1N3FETkUyZndFS3RvRDVyRmRqSlpJSEVIUmhId055Zy1ZN25Yd0lPQXlrNWFmTDdDT0VnZ2Q1c0J5UTNRX0RmSWN6NUtXd0xxR3I4R1lwUEowOENjUmZacGZF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Audacy&